{"availability":"available","full":"valentina-b/out2fashion-weather-clothing-app","name":"out2fashion-weather-clothing-app","description":"OUT2FASHION - Clothing App Using Weather API Data - Stay Stylish in Major Cities - valentina-b.github.io/out2fashion-weather-clothing-app/","category":"Developer tools","language":"JavaScript","stars":3,"forks":1,"created":"2020-04-03T10:12:38Z","updated":"2020-05-05T16:46:07Z","branch":"master","homepage":"https://valentina-b.github.io/out2fashion-weather-clothing-app/","topics":[],"demo":"https://valentina-b.github.io/out2fashion-weather-clothing-app/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-07T21:24:02.977Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-07T21:24:02.977Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-07T21:24:02.977Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-07T21:24:02.977Z","stars":3,"forks":1}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Code Institute - Milestone Project 2 - Interactive Frontend Development","OUT2FASHION is a mobile-first one-page web application that helps women stay stylish every day based on the clothing items they might need according to the weather forecast. The primary purpose of this web app is to inform the users about the daily weather forecast in a fun and interactive way and to serve as a guidance for shopping relevant clothing items for their outfit of the day - buy what you like but also what you need! The secondary purpose is to give fashion brands an additional chance to market their products by every-day brand exposure in hope of increasing the sales.","The overall goal of the app is to turn a simple daily repetitive act of checking weather forecast to plan out the outfit of the day into a fun experience. Besides the weather forecast, the app informs the users about the new clothing products on the market which are only 1 click away."],"features":["As a first step, I've put together all the goals mentioned above and checked where they overlap.","Then I grouped them into Information and Features category. The Information category is a group of goals that can be easily solved by simply including the relevant information in the app. The Features are goals that…","Top navigation bar - fixed on the top so that the users are able to navigate themselves back to the homepage anytime.","Header - introduction to the website. Once the user clicks on a city below the header, the header content changes to horizontal scrolling menu so that the users can access other cities' weather data once the homepage…","Main section - Homepage - provides 8 cities for the users to choose from and an additional information on how the app works."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/valentina-b/out2fashion-weather-clothing-app/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"b74a3ec2e420636587ccbbbf518ab7c91d577983f0021354fa5e633a4bac2588","extractedAt":"2026-10-07T21:24:03.209Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-07T21:24:03.209Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Code Institute - Milestone Project 2 - Interactive Frontend Development","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/valentina-b/out2fashion-weather-clothing-app/blob/master/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Additionally, the user could also create an account where they could save products for later.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/valentina-b/out2fashion-weather-clothing-app/blob/master/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"b74a3ec2e420636587ccbbbf518ab7c91d577983f0021354fa5e633a4bac2588","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/valentina-b/out2fashion-weather-clothing-app/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-07T21:24:03.211Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2020-05-05T16:46:07Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/valentina-b/out2fashion-weather-clothing-app/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-07T21:24:03.214Z","hash":"b74a3ec2e420636587ccbbbf518ab7c91d577983f0021354fa5e633a4bac2588","originalBytes":32364,"storedBytes":32364,"truncated":